  "details": "I was looking around for the setting to change your age verified badge display on the VRC website, and I get sent to a dead-end. \n\n1. I opened up the Account Settings page (which is where I remember the setting being in the early days of age verification) and scrolled down to the age verification section. Instructions say \"You have successfully verified your age. You may choose whether to display it on your profile.\" With a button to go to your profile just below.\n\n2. Click the \"Go to my Profile\" button\n\n3. Click the \"Edit Profile\" button\n\n4. In the profile editor window that comes up, I see nothing that lets me change the visibility of my verified 18+ badge.\n\nAm I missing something? If this is a setting that is intended to only be changeable in-game, then the redirect from the Account Settings page should be updated to specify that is the intent. \n\nThanks for looking into this!",
